uto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b1ec97-a393-443a-9867-b160d30825be_383x500.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!76BF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b1ec97-a393-443a-9867-b160d30825be_383x500.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!76BF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa7b1ec97-a393-443a-9867-b160d30825be_383x500.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a>",
